ues from {alphas[0]:.6f} to {alphas[-1]:.2f}\")\n","\n","lasso = Lasso(max_iter=10000, random_state=42)\n","\n","#Executing grid search with GroupKFold to ensure school-level independence\n","lasso_grid = GridSearchCV(\n","    estimator=lasso,\n","    param_grid={'alpha': alphas},\n","    cv=group_kfold,\n","    scoring='r2',\n","    n_jobs=-1,\n","    return_train_score=True,\n","    verbose=1\n",")\n","\n","lasso_grid.fit(X_train, y_train, groups=groups_train)\n","\n","#Retrieving Lasso results and identifying the best alpha value\n","print(f\"\\nBest alpha: {lasso_grid.best_params_['alpha']:.6f}\")\n","print(f\"Best CV R2: {lasso_grid.best_score_:.4f}\")\n","\n","best_lasso = lasso_grid.best_estimator_\n","\n","#Performing feature selection analysis to identify predictors with non-zero coefficients\n","lasso_coef = pd.DataFrame({\n","    'Feature': feature_names,\n","    'Coefficient': best_lasso.coef_\n","})\n","\n","selected_features = lasso_coef[lasso_coef['Coefficient'] != 0]\n","zero_features = lasso_coef[lasso_coef['Coefficient'] == 0]\n","\n","print(f\"\\nFeatures retained: {len(selected_features)} of {len(feature_names)}\")\n","print(f\"Features eliminated: {len(zero_features)}\")\n","\n","#Sorting retained features by their impact on the model\n","selected_sorted = selected_features.copy()\n","selected_sorted['abs_coef'] = abs(selected_sorted['Coefficient'])\n","selected_sorted = selected_sorted.sort_values('abs_coef', ascending=False).drop('abs_coef', axis=1)\n","\n","#Comparing Lasso coefficients with previous MLR results to evaluate shrinkage\n","mlr_coef_dict = {\n","    'conf_B2': 0.4613, 'conf_B6': 0.4522, 'digi_C1c': 0.3084,\n","    'digi_C1d': 0.2980, 'digi_C2e': 0.2570, 'train_E5': 0.2065,\n","    'res_D3': 0.2043, 'res_D5': 0.1885, 'train_E2': 0.1667,\n","    'res_D1': 0.1655, 'res_D6': 0.1651, 'train_E3': 0.1640,\n","    'train_E4': 0.1608, 'train_E7': 0.1574, 'res_D2': 0.1515,\n","    'res_D4': 0.1428, 'train_E6': 0.1408, 'training_attended_binary': 0.0333,\n","    'Digital_x_Training': -0.0024\n","}\n","\n","comparison = []\n","for feature in feature_names:\n","    mlr_val = mlr_coef_dict.get(feature, 0)\n","    lasso_val = best_lasso.coef_[feature_names.index(feature)]\n","    comparison.append({\n","        'Feature': feature,\n","        'MLR': mlr_val,\n","        'Lasso': lasso_val,\n","        'Difference': mlr_val - lasso_val\n","    })\n","\n","comp_df = pd.DataFrame(comparison).sort_values('MLR', ascending=False)\n","print(comp_df.to_string(index=False, float_format=lambda x: f\"{x:.4f}\"))\n","\n","#Visualizing the regularization path and cross-validation performance\n","coef_paths = []\n","for alpha in alphas:\n","    lasso_temp = Lasso(alpha=alpha, max_iter=10000, random_state=42)\n","    lasso_temp.fit(X_train, y_train)\n","    coef_paths.append(lasso_temp.coef_)\n","\n","coef_paths = np.array(coef_paths)\n","fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 2, figsize=(14, 12))\n","\n","#Plotting coefficient shrinkage as alpha increases\n","for i in range(len(feature_names)):\n","    axes[0, 0].plot(alphas, coef_paths[:, i], label=feature_names[i] if i < 10 else \"\")\n","axes[0, 0].axvline(x=best_lasso.alpha, color='red', linestyle='--', label=f'Best alpha')\n","axes[0, 0].set_xscale('log')\n","axes[0, 0].set_title('Lasso Regularization Path')\n","axes[0, 0].legend(loc='upper right', fontsize=8, ncol=2)\n","axes[0, 0].grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n","\n","#Mapping R2 score against alpha to confirm the optimal point\n","cv_mean = lasso_grid.cv_results_['mean_test_score']\n","cv_std = lasso_grid.cv_results_['std_test_score']\n","axes[0, 1].plot(alphas, cv_mean, 'b-', label='CV Score')\n","axes[0, 1].fill_between(alphas, cv_mean - cv_std, cv_mean + cv_std, alpha=0.2)\n","axes[0, 1].axvline(x=best_lasso.alpha, color='red', linestyle='--')\n","axes[0, 1].set_xscale('log')\n","axes[0, 1].set_title('Cross-Validation Score vs Alpha')\n","axes[0, 1].grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n","\n","#Tracking feature elimination across the alpha range\n","n_features = np.sum(coef_paths != 0, axis=1)\n","axes[1, 0].plot(alphas, n_features, 'g-', linewidth=2)\n","axes[1, 0].axvline(x=best_lasso.alpha, color='red', linestyle='--')\n","axes[1, 0].set_xscale('log')\n","axes[1, 0].set_title('Feature Selection vs Alpha')\n","axes[1, 0].grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n","\n","#Directly comparing MLR vs Lasso coefficients to show the effect of regularization\n","\n","x = np.arange(len(comp_df))\n","width = 0.35\n","axes[1, 1].bar(x - width/2, comp_df['MLR'], width, label='MLR', alpha=0.8)\n","axes[1, 1].bar(x + width/2, comp_df['Lasso'], width, label='Lasso', alpha=0.8)\n","axes[1, 1].set_title('MLR vs Lasso Coefficients')\n","axes[1, 1].set_xticks(x)\n","axes[1, 1].set_xticklabels(comp_df['Feature'], rotation=45, ha='right', fontsize=8)\n","axes[1, 1].legend()\n","axes[1, 1].grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n","\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","plt.savefig('../outputs/figures/04_lasso_analysis.png', dpi=300, bbox_inches='tight')\n","plt.show()\n","\n","#Archiving coefficients and the selected feature list for later use\n","lasso_coef.to_csv('../outputs/tables/04_lasso_coefficients.csv', index=False)\n","joblib.dump(best_lasso, '../outputs/models/04_lasso_model.pkl')"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":1000},"id":"qGN1MHR5-U3f","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1773840757887,"user_tz":-180,"elapsed":10286,"user":{"displayName":"Peter Kanyuira","userId":"15903363713790779386"}},"outputId":"e2b49f38-e123-4a18-c774-41e8250d34f8"},"execution_count":9,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Testing 100 alpha values from 0.000100 to 10.00\n","Fitting 5 folds for each of 100 candidates, totalling 500 fits\n","\n","Best alpha: 0.002310\n","Best CV R2: 0.9699\n","\n","Features retained: 18 of 19\n","Features eliminated: 1\n","                 Feature     MLR   Lasso  Difference\n","                 conf_B2  0.4613  0.4596      0.0017\n","                 conf_B6  0.4522  0.4501      0.00