 Training Attendance vs. Quality\n","The analysis highlights a significant gap between mere participation and the perceived quality of training:\n","\n","Attendance: The binary variable for attending training has a very small effect size (0.03–0.06).\n","\n","Quality: Individual training quality items show much larger effects (0.14–0.20).\n","\n","Key Insight: For policy development, the quality and specific content of the training sessions matter significantly more than the simple act of attendance."],"metadata":{"id":"9f-c2Gpw_H3t"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["#Setting up Decision Tree with hyperparameter tuning to capture non-linear thresholds\n","from sklearn.tree import DecisionTreeRegressor, plot_tree, export_text\n","param_grid = {\n","    'max_depth': [3, 5, 7, 10, None],\n","    'min_samples_split': [5, 10, 20, 30],\n","    'min_samples_leaf': [2, 5, 10, 15]\n","}\n","\n","print(f\"\\nHyperparameter grid combinations: {len(param_grid['max_depth']) * len(param_grid['min_samples_split']) * len(param_grid['min_samples_leaf'])}\")\n","\n","dt = DecisionTreeRegressor(random_state=42)\n","\n","#Executing grid search using GroupKFold for robust parameter optimization\n","dt_grid = GridSearchCV(\n","    estimator=dt,\n","    param_grid=param_grid,\n","    cv=group_kfold,\n","    scoring='r2',\n","    n_jobs=-1,\n","    return_train_score=True,\n","    verbose=1\n",")\n","\n","dt_grid.fit(X_train, y_train, groups=groups_train)\n","\n","#Retrieving optimal parameters and best cross-validation R2 score\n","print(f\"\\nBest parameters: {dt_grid.best_params_}\")\n","print(f\"Best CV R2: {dt_grid.best_score_:.4f}\")\n","\n","best_dt = dt_grid.best_estimator_\n","\n","#Modelling feature importance to identify primary branch drivers\n","dt_importance = pd.DataFrame({\n","    'Feature': feature_names,\n","    'Importance': best_dt.feature_importances_\n","}).sort_values('Importance', ascending=False)\n","\n","print(\"\\nTop 10 most important features (Decision Tree):\")